flowchart TB
    accTitle: Qleisli native verifier architecture
    accDescr: The verifier checks the request context and independently checks the payload. Execution and caller scopes also require an exact execution-view match.
    Request["QLV3 request"] --> Decode["Validate context and decode"]
    Decode --> Check["Check artifact and evidence"]
    Check -->|Inspection| Report["Inspection decision"]
    Check -->|Execution or caller scope| Compare["Compare QDV1 views"]
    Compare -->|Match| Accepted["Scoped successful decision"]
    Compare -->|Mismatch| Reject["Reject"]
    classDef acceptance fill:#e5f3ed,stroke:#35694f,color:#173f2b,stroke-width:2px
